Bundled training frameworks (each directory keeps its original license and notice files):

training/verl-agent/
    The verl-agent training framework as used by SkillRL (MIT, AIMING Lab), built on
    verl-agent (Apache-2.0, Nanyang Technological University and the verl-agent team)
    and verl (Apache-2.0, Bytedance Ltd.). Copied from the SkillRL codebase our ALFWorld
    and WebShop runs used; only the modules needed for training are included, and
    machine-specific paths were removed.

training/agentgym-rl/
    AgentGym-RL (MIT, FudanNLP-Agent) with its verl fork (Apache-2.0, Bytedance Ltd.)
    and AgentGym's agentenv client and agentenv-webarena server (MIT, FudanNLP-Agent),
    which bundles WebArena (Apache-2.0). Copied from the codebase our WebArena run used,
    together with the harness modules its rollout imports; endpoints were made generic
    (OpenAI-compatible) and site credentials are not included.

evoharness/envs/alfworld/config_tw.yaml is the TextWorld configuration distributed
with ALFWorld (MIT License). The WebArena instruction in
evoharness/envs/webarena/prompts.py is the standard WebArena agent prompt.
